{"version": 2, "width": 120, "height": 33, "timestamp": 1793455443, "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "rec_05_causality (cut)"}
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 198 +\u001b[38;5;231mfailure, not a node failure.**                                                                        \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 199 +\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                                      \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 200 +\u001b[38;5;231mEvery ring-down array you store must begin at least **5 s before** its step boundary and carry an     \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 201 +\u001b[38;5;231mexplicit time axis with `t = 0` at the boundary, so that `t < 0` samples exist and are identifiable.  \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 202 +\u001b[38;5;231mA deliverable whose earliest sample is at `t = 0` cannot be tested and does not satisfy section 3.    \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 203 +\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                                      \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 204 +\u001b[38;5;231m**What the test actually is, because the naive version is meaningless here.** The detector is *not*   \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 205 +\u001b[38;5;231mquiet before a boundary: the previous tone is driving it at full amplitude. \"Is there signal before   \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 206 +\u001b[38;5;231mt = 0\" is therefore always yes and tests nothing. The causal statement that has content is about the  \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 207 +\u001b[38;5;231m**incoming** tone:                                                                                    \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 208 +\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                                      \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 209 +\u001b[38;5;231m> No coherent response at the NEW drive frequency `f_new` may exist before `f_new` is switched on.    \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 210 +\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                                      \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 211 +\u001b[38;5;231mSo measure, per boundary and per channel, the amplitude at `f_new` in a window ending at the          \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 212 +\u001b[38;5;231mboundary, and compare it against the same quantity measured after. Report the pre/post amplitude      \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 213 +\u001b[38;5;231mratio. **Fail if it exceeds 0.2.**                                                                    \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 214 +\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                                      \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 215 +\u001b[38;5;231mThree things make this a real test rather than a formality, and you must address each:                \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 216 +\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                                      \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 217 +\u001b[38;5;231m1. **Use a measured boundary, not an assumed one.** A response that appears to precede the boundary   \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246m\u2026 17 more lines \u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0Allowed by auto mode\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[39m Running \u001b[1m1\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m shell command\u2026\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf  $ ./tools/rec.sh start rec_05_causality\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;174m\u00b7\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;174mDilly-dallying\u2026 \u001b[38;5;246m(56s \u00b7 \u2193\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m3.3k tokens)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0Tip: Connect Claude to your IDE \u00b7 /ide\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m\u276f\u00a0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;220m\u23f5\u23f5 auto mode on\u001b[38;5;246m (shift+tab to cycle) \u00b7 esc to interrupt\u001b[39m\u001b[31;3H"]
