equency\u001b[53G\u001b[38;5;153mf_new\u001b[59G\u001b[39mmay\u001b[63Gexist\u001b[69Gbefore\u001b[76G\u001b[38;5;153mf_new\u001b[82G\u001b[39mis\u001b[85Gswitched\u001b[94Gon.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BAnd\u001b[7Git\u001b[10Gnames\u001b[16Gthree\u001b[22Gadversaries\u001b[34Gthe\u001b[38Gnode\u001b[43Gmust\u001b[48Gaddress,\u001b[57Gnot\u001b[61Gjust\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gratio:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mMeasured boundaries, not assumed ones\u001b[44G\u001b[22m\u2014\u001b[46Ga\u001b[48Gpre-response\u001b[61Gsmaller\u001b[69Gthan\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Gboundary\u001b[87Guncertainty\u001b[99Gis\u001b[102Ga\u001b[104Gtiming\u001b[111Gerror,\u001b[118Gnot\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gacausality. I handed it the r6c measurement: spacing 250.0003 s at \u03c3 37\u001b[78Gms, \u001b[38;5;153msteps.csv\u001b[39m l\u001b[94Gte by 5.986 s, and its own\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bfirst-run bound\u001b[22Gri\u001b[25Gs\u001b[27Gearly by 0.434 s.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mSpectral leakage mimics acausality\u001b[22m \u2014 a\u001b[45Gfinite\u001b[52Gwindow\u001b[59Gat\u001b[62G\u001b[38;5;153mf_old\u001b[68G\u001b[39mleaks\u001b[74Ginto\u001b[79G\u001b[38;5;153mf_new\u001b[85G\u001b[39monly\u001b[90G0.1\u001b[94GHz\u001b[97Gaway.\u001b[103GUnquantified,\u001b[117Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gratio is uninterpretable. I flagged this as the main\u001b[60Gdversary, \u001b[71Gnd\u001b[75Gt's\u001b[79Gthe most likely re\u001b[98Gson the tes\u001b[110G comes\u001b[117Gback\u001b[33;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[38.035045, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRecording,\u001b[14Gspec\u001b[19Gamended,\u001b[28Ganalyst\u001b[36Gdispatched.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[1mSPEC \u00a74.5 added \u2014 and the naive test would have been meaningless\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[22mThe flaw in E035 was that the spec asked for a causality test but\u001b[69Gnever\u001b[75Grequired\u001b[84Ganyone\u001b[91Gto\u001b[94G\u001b[1mstore\u001b[100G\u001b[22mpre-boundary\u001b[113Gsamples.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSo\u001b[6Gthe\u001b[10Gamendment\u001b[20Gis\u001b[23Gfirst\u001b[29Ga\u001b[31Gstorage\u001b[39Grequirement:\u001b[52Gring-downs\u001b[63Gmust\u001b[68Gbegin\u001b[74G\u22655\u001b[77Gs\u001b[79Gbefore\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gboundary,\u001b[100Gwith\u001b[105G\u001b[38;5;153mt = 0\u001b[111G\u001b[39mat\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bboundary.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BBut writing\u001b[15Git\u001b[18Gforced\u001b[25Ga\u001b[27Gsecond\u001b[34Gproblem\u001b[42Ginto\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Gopen.\u001b[57GThe\u001b[61Gobvious\u001b[69Gtest\u001b[74G\u2014\u001b[76G\"is\u001b[80Gthere\u001b[86Gsignal\u001b[93Gbefore\u001b[100Gt=0?\"\u001b[106G\u2014\u001b[108Gis\u001b[111G\u001b[1mvacuous \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhere\u001b[22m,\u001b[9Gbecause\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gdetector\u001b[30Gisn't\u001b[36Gquiet\u001b[42Gbefore\u001b[49Ga\u001b[51Gboundary:\u001b[61Gthe\u001b[65Gprevious\u001b[74Gtone\u001b[79Gis\u001b[82Gdriving\u001b[90Git\u001b[93Gat\u001b[96Gfull\u001b[101Gamplitude.\u001b[112GThe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Banswe\u001b[9G is always yes.\u001b[25G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSo the\u001b[10Gclause defines\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Gtest\u001b[34Gthat\u001b[39Gdoes\u001b[44Ghave\u001b[49Gcontent:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[2m\u258e\u001b[22m No coherent\u001b[17Gr\u001b[19Gspon\u001b[24Ge at\u001b[30Ghe \u001b[1mnew\u001b[22m driv\u001b[42G frequency \u001b[38;5;153mf_new\u001b[59G\u001b[39mmay\u001b[63Gexist\u001b[6